    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97041" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόρθυγξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">υγγος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ὁ</span> or ἡ (both in <i><span class="en">
